      "id": "ea13279348095776d09d47bb",
      "title": "Day",
      "summary": "Day is a day-by-day alarm and reminder. It sits on the taskbar (or hide it with Ghost) and pops up when you asked it to. Alarms can repeat once, daily, weekdays, weekly, monthly or yearly, with an optional five-minute early warning. Version 1.33. New: Dawn, a tiny starter you put in Startup instead of Day itself, so you get a yes/no prompt at boot. Written…",
