      "id": "4c7d2add1db4f649f0a05906",
      "title": "Messages",
      "summary": "Messages is a small utility for leaving notes for other people who use the same PC. Handy if you are sharing a machine with Windows 95’s multi-user password facility. It manages multiple message files and uses Notepad to edit them. Version 1.11, 16-bit and 32-bit builds. Visual Basic. Windows 3.1x and 95/NT. Archived page: gingerbeardman.com/archive/tektoni…",
      "image": "https://cdn.gingerbeardman.com/images/posts/tektonix-messages.gif",
      "publishedAt": "1996-10-06T16:42:00Z",
