    },
    {
      "id": "47e560c5be082a055664f852",
      "title": "MsgBoxer",
      "summary": "MsgBoxer generates Visual Basic MsgBox code to your exact specification. Pick the icon, buttons, default button and modality in a dialog, hit Test, then paste the snippet into your app from the clipboard. Now with context-sensitive help. Version 1.11b, 16-bit and 32-bit. Windows 3.1x and 95/NT. This is a tool I wrote because I was tired of looking up the Ms…",
